A||||9||Homicidal||My Fiero only holds 5.3 GALLONS OF GAS?!?!?!||||5||
Z||000000||Homicidal||06-18-2000||03:05 AM||||I actually JUST noticed this about 2 weeks ago:  I reached EMPTY on my gas, so I went to get gas as usual.  As I was pumping (my $10 usual), I noticed my tank was full (it was overflowing) so I normally put the nozzle back.<P>But when I looked at the gallons it said I only put 5.3 in!  I know my 84 Fiero has a 10.1 in it!  What is wrong here?||||reg||5
Z||000001||tgowens||06-18-2000||03:38 AM||||hmmmmmmmm, bad guage maybe?? or is your neighbor siphoning gas during the day and refilling it before you go to fill up?||||reg||1
